Compiler research notes from the [Typerighter](https://github.com/huydo862003/typerighter) project.

- ${fref("./rust-analyzer/high-level-architecture.td")}: Architecture, crates, invariants.
- ${fref("./rust-analyzer/syntax-tree-and-parser.td")}: Red-green trees, rowan, 3-layer syntax tree, parsing.
- ${fref("./rust-analyzer/coding-conventions.td")}: Style, testing, error handling.
- ${fref("./rust-analyzer/tests.td")}: Snapshot testing, fixtures, expect-test.
- ${fref("./rustc/incremental-compilation.td")}: Red-green algorithm, persistence, fingerprints.
- ${fref("./rustc/cache-persistence.td")}: Physical cache layout, load/write algorithms.
- ${fref("./rustc/stable-hash.td")}: StableHash trait, SipHash, hashing context.
- ${fref("./rustc/glossary.td")}: DefId, DefPath, Fingerprint, DepNode, etc.
- ${fref("./salsa/overview.td")}: Incremental computation framework.
- ${fref("./libsyntax.td")}: libsyntax-2.0 RFC.
